----
'ONE TO ONE'. Cardinality is now inferred from PK/UNIQUE constraints; explicit keywords are no longer supported

# B-181: body_parser/mod.rs::old_cardinality_keywords_rejected — a trailing `ONE TO MANY` cardinality keyword is rejected (near miss of B-178) [text]
statement error
